    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help him impregnate a town full of women </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Builder, you play the role of a skilled young man who is commissioned to build a memorial in a village in the far north. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon you discover that your real task is quite different: In order to save the village from extinction, you must make all the women there pregnant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is a choice based visual novel game. It has a clear and engaging storyline and a rich cast of characters. Get ready for an experience out of the ordinary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We follow the main character through a full year of work - all the way to the completion of the memorial - and the successful breeding of the women of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is a sophisticated adult visual novel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season 1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Season 1 you play through how our hero gets his mission, his arrival in town and his first challenges with starting his work. You also meet the women of Fjorda and have to find your way to their hearts and wombs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 6 seasons (30 episodes) are planned. The story is currently near the end of Season 2, and is available here on Steam in early access here on Steam at the same time as Season 1. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support the development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support the development of The Builder, you can wishlist it here on Steam and spread the word.</p>",
